	set_func_cmt(0X15284,	"Detects the video adapter and sets videoType (0=CGA, 1=EGA, 2=Tandy). Checks the ROM BIOS machine-ID byte at F000:FFFE for a PCjr/Tandy signature (0FDh, or 0FFh followed by a 5-byte match against a signature string in video memory at A000:5FFF), otherwise falls back to INT 10h AH=12h BL=10h (\"Get EGA Info\") to distinguish EGA from plain CGA. Called once by initVideo.", 0);
